  unitName: Ice Warrior Karl
  unitId: 20234
  unitNumber: 335
  description: A mock Unit modeled after Karl, a Summoner belonging to the Akras
    Summoners' Hall. Though already considered to be one of the strongest around,
    it is said his hidden power is even more outstanding. Karl's birth is clouded
    in mystery so much so that even he doesn't know anything himself, but there are
    some who believe he has ties to the Summoners' Hall's upper echelon, rumoring
    that "He's descended from kings," "His blood is that of a god's," and "He was
    born in Grand Gaia." Karl neither confirmed nor denied these claims, instead
    simply smiling in response.
  summonDesc: Hey there, my friend!<br>This is my ascended form.<br>I look forward
    to battle with you!
  fusionDesc: I must get stronger so that<br>I can fight alongside you!<br>I will
    always have your back!
  evoDesc: What's this power!?<br>I can feel something strange<br>burning inside
    of me!
  element: 2
  rarity: 4
